   196	| 0 | Interval sieve (baseline) | 1/ρ(x/ln y) = L[2/3, 2/(3κ)] | no | L[1/2, √2] (u and v both tested; Theorem SS, λ ≈ x) | MODEL; MEASURED toy |
   197	| 1 | Log-knapsack / CVP in Adleman's lattice | near-exact CVP_{1+O(1/x)} in dim L[1/3]: 2^{Θ(n)} = exp(L[1/3, κ]); BKZ-β, β < n: residue N^{Θ(1)} | no | worse than trial division | Prop CV PROVED; costs SCENARIO |
   198	| 2 | MITM, sorted logs, one list for all k | 2√(N/(R(h+1))) = N^{1/2−o(1)} | no | ≥ √(RN/h): exponential | Lemma MA; MEASURED E1/E2 |
   199	| 2′ | k-list / k-tree / representations | ≥ (N/h)^{1/2}/R^{O(1)} | no | exponential | MODEL |
