   346	  The brute-force column above uses the H-T value at N for the comparison with MITM (whose products lie in [N, 4N]).
   347	- P2d: MITM cheaper than brute force at every size: PASS (80 bits: 6.1e4–6.7e4 vs ≈ 3e9).
