notes/suffmap_results.md-76-| C | the same on the algebraic side | inf 0.7631 | open |
notes/suffmap_results.md-77-| C | beyond-Johnson output-sensitive CRT list decoding; H_sel violations | c(θ) | open, implausible |
notes/suffmap_results.md-78-| C | sparse F₂ linear algebra with ω < 2 | 1.8595 (MNFS only) | open, plausible-ish |
