notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-125-
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-126-Notation:
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-127-- N is odd, not a prime power, with no prime factor ≤ B (trial-divide first).
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-128-- P = {p₁, …, p_n} are the primes ≤ B; ℓ_i = ln p_i; L = ln N.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-129-- e ∈ Z^n gives coprime u = ∏_{e_i>0}p_i^{e_i}, v = ∏_{e_i<0}p_i^{−e_i}, and w = u − vN.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-130-- A *fac-relation* has |w| P-smooth. It gives u ≡ w (mod N).
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-131-
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-132-**The lattices** (literature critic):
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-133-- **Schnorr 1991**: diagonal ℓ_i, last row N^c ℓ_i, target (0, …, 0, N^c L), **ℓ1 norm**. B = (ln N)^α, c > 1.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-134-  Rigorous Thm 2: ‖z − N‖₁ ≤ (2c−1)L + 2δ ln B ⇒ |u − vN| ≤ B^{1/α+δ+o(1)}.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-135-- **Adleman 1995** (draft of 16 March 1995, SchnorrGate `LATFAC.pdf`, read in full): diagonal √ℓ_j, ℓ2, exact SVP,
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-136-  first column M·ln p_j with M = N⁴, row V₀ = (M(ln N + γ), 0, …), B = ln^{20}(2N^{1.25}).
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-137-- **Vera 2010** (arXiv 1003.5461): ℓ_p versions with weights ℓ_i^{1/p}. Remark 9 asks for an ℓ2 analysis.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-138-- **Schnorr 2021**: diagonal f(i), a random permutation, C = N′ = N^{1/(n+1)}, SVP on the (n+1)-dimensional
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-139-  embedding.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-140-- **We** use Adleman's ℓ2 weights in CVP form: b(e) = (√ℓ₁e₁, …, √ℓ_ne_n, C⟨e,ℓ⟩), t = (0, …, 0, CL).
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-141-  Q(e) = Σℓ_ie_i², A(e) = Σ|e_i|ℓ_i = ln(uv), Δ = ⟨e,ℓ⟩ − L.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-142-
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-143-**Theorem R [PROVED].**
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-144-- (i) ‖b(e) − t‖² = Q + C²Δ².
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-145-- (ii) w = vN(e^Δ − 1) = 2e^{(A+L)/2} sinh(Δ/2).
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-146-- (iii) A ≤ Q, with equality iff uv is squarefree.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-147-- (iv) gcd(uv, w) = 1.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-148-- (v) |uw| ≥ N − 1 whenever u − vN = w with u, v, w ≠ 0.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-149-
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-150-*Proof.*
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-151-- (ii): vN = e^{(A+L−Δ)/2}.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-152-- (iii): |e_i| ≤ e_i².
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-153-- (iv): p | u, w ⇒ p | vN; p | v, w ⇒ p | u.
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-154-- (v): N ≤ |v|N ≤ |u| + |w| ≤ |uw| + 1. ∎
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-155-
