notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-255-  γ − 1 ≤ c_κ ln B/L with c_κ = (1 − 3/(2κ))/(1 + 2a) + o(1).
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-256-- Since ln B/L = n^{−1/κ+o(1)}:
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-257-
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-258-> **factoring ≤ CVP_{1+n^{−ε}} on Schnorr–Adleman prime lattices of dimension n = (ln N)^κ, for any fixed
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-259-> κ > max(2, 1/ε), with O(n log N) oracle calls. Heuristic in H_S (per target) and H_LA; ERH; N not a prime power.**
