notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-262-slack 1 + O(ln B/L) yields relations under his Hypothesis. New here, as far as we found:
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-263-- the ℓ2 (Adleman-weight) certificate, which answers Vera's Remark 9;
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-264-- the explicit constant c_κ and approximation-factor form;
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-265-- the rigorous distinctness;
notes/schnorrcvp_results.md-266-- the kernel-basis Lemma LA.
