   131	
   132	**The lattices** (literature critic):
   133	- **Schnorr 1991**: diagonal ℓ_i, last row N^c ℓ_i, target (0, …, 0, N^c L), **ℓ1 norm**. B = (ln N)^α, c > 1.
   134	  Rigorous Thm 2: ‖z − N‖₁ ≤ (2c−1)L + 2δ ln B ⇒ |u − vN| ≤ B^{1/α+δ+o(1)}.
