375-- *RS decoding hardness* [KNOWN]:
376-  - Guruswami–Vardy (IEEE TIT 51, 2005): maximum-likelihood decoding is NP-hard;
377-  - Cheng–Wan (FOCS 2004 / SICOMP 37 (2007); IEEE TIT 56 (2010), bounded-distance at (2/3 + ε)·distance): links
378-    to discrete logarithm;
379-  - Gandikota–Ghazi–Grigorescu (FOCS 2016): NP-hardness near n − k − O(log n/log log n).
