The numerical cost constants and pooled E1–E3 figures reproduce. Two claims need narrower statements: generic CVP runtimes do not bound this structured lattice family, and \(Kh\ll a\) makes the merge’s candidate points collinear—it does not limit them to \(O(1)\). I’ve also checked an exact-CVP example that returns a number below the requested interval.
